<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish May s/a trade surplus 603.3 mln punts-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish May s/a trade surplus 603.3 mln punts-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's seasonally adjusted trade surplus widened to 603.3 million punts from 572.9 million punts in April, Central Statistics Office figures show.</p>
<p>			   Imports	Exports	     Gap</p>
<p> Latest		  1,769.3	2,372.5	  603.3 million</p>
<p> Previous		1,813.4	2,386.4	  572.9 million</p>
<p> Year-ago		1,634.7	2,245.6	  610.9 million</p>
<p>		   (Figures in millions of punts)</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
